<p id="S5.SS3.p2.1.22" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS3.p2.1.22.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Move 18 completed. Mouse M4 has won! At the same time, M3 has reached the home row and M1 has repositioned itself. I await your “Ok” to proceed to Step D: Confirmation and Checksum.</span></p>
