<p id="A1.SS7.SSSx1.p1.1.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS7.SSSx1.p1.1.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Awaiting your “Ok” to fix this initial state (J0) and proceed to Step B: Strategic Proposal.</span></p>
<p id="A1.SS7.SSSx1.p1.1.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS7.SSSx1.p1.1.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Supervisor:<span id="A1.SS7.SSSx1.p1.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A1.SS7.SSSx1.p1.1.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(ok) I confirm.</span></span></span></p>
</blockquote>
