<li id="A1.I33.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I33.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I33.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I33.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Pre-Move + Move:</span><span id="A1.I33.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="A1.I33.i3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">J&lt;#&gt;: G@P&lt;XY&gt;:b=&lt;N&gt; ; G@P&lt;XY&gt;&lt;spin&gt;</span></p>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="A1.SS8.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Example of a move with gear to be placed on the board: </span><span id="A1.SS8.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">J1: G2@P21(b=0)+90</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS8.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS8.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS8.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Example of a move with all gears Placed on the board: </span><span id="A1.SS8.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">J11: G@P11+90</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS8.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS8.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS8.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Example of a pre-play + play: </span><span id="A1.SS8.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">J10: G@P21:b=1 ; G@P11-90</span></p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS8.SSSx1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
